#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QWidget, VeritasConfig)
#: config/veritasconfig.ui:19
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Test settings.\n"
"\n"
"Select the test framework used in the project and set its detailed "
"configuration.\n"
"\n"
"Then you can add, edit and remove the test executables to be run. Once "
"added, they can be run in the tool view of the framework test.\n"
"\n"
"Note that you may not be able to add, edit or remove tests if the test "
"framework and the build manager support automatic test discovery. In that "
"case, just select the project in the tool view of the framework test and the "
"test executables will be added automatically."
msgstr ""

